{"logId": "b51e4330-fa69-4676-8052-a9e153fbed22", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [122, 92, 192, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[122.0, 92.0], [192.0, 92.0], [192.0, 128.0], [122.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "抢劫事件的预防及处理方法：", "block_bbox": [125, 160, 414, 190], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[125.0, 160.0], [414.0, 160.0], [414.0, 190.0], [125.0, 190.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、穿戴适宜，尽量使自己活动方便；", "block_bbox": [125, 218, 455, 244], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[125.0, 218.0], [455.0, 218.0], [455.0, 244.0], [125.0, 244.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、发现有人尾随或窥视，不要紧张露出胆怯神态，可回头多盯对方几眼，或哼首歌曲，并改变原走路线，朝有人、有灯的地方走；或打手机通知人接护。", "block_bbox": [125, 251, 767, 344], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[125.0, 251.0], [767.0, 251.0], [767.0, 344.0], [125.0, 344.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、如果歹徒向你要皮夹或钱包，不要递给他，而是往远处丢去。歹徒很可能对财物比对你有兴趣，他会去拿皮夹或钱包，这是你逃跑的机会。往反方向拼命跑，待安全后，及时报警。", "block_bbox": [125, 351, 753, 444], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[125.0, 351.0], [753.0, 351.0], [753.0, 444.0], [125.0, 444.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、永远搭电梯，不要走楼梯。（楼梯间是一个可怕的地方，容易让人形单影支，变成最好的犯罪场所。）", "block_bbox": [125, 450, 750, 510], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[125.0, 450.0], [750.0, 450.0], [750.0, 510.0], [125.0, 510.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "12、假如歹徒有凶器而你并没有受到他的控制，一定要跑，一百次中，只有四次歹徒会袭击逃跑的目标；即使他攻击你，大多不会是致命的部位，所以要跑。", "block_bbox": [124, 517, 749, 610], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[124.0, 517.0], [749.0, 517.0], [749.0, 610.0], [124.0, 610.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 258, 1075, 464], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 258.0], [1075.0, 258.0], [1075.0, 464.0], [839.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "生活篇--盗窃事件", "block_bbox": [93, 678, 309, 712], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[93.0, 678.0], [309.0, 678.0], [309.0, 712.0], [93.0, 712.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [123, 763, 191, 802], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[123.0, 763.0], [191.0, 763.0], [191.0, 802.0], [123.0, 802.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、盗窃事件：", "block_bbox": [143, 832, 298, 864], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[143.0, 832.0], [298.0, 832.0], [298.0, 864.0], [143.0, 864.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [143, 888, 210, 916], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[143.0, 888.0], [209.0, 888.0], [209.0, 915.0], [143.0, 915.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、2011年，一员工在冯庄租的民房，因夏季天气炎热晚上没关窗户，刚发的工资还没来得及存银行被盗；", "block_bbox": [141, 959, 762, 1023], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 959.0], [762.0, 959.0], [762.0, 1023.0], [141.0, 1023.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、2012年，一员工在罗庄租的民房，下班后回到住处发现门锁被撬，房间里被洗劫一空；", "block_bbox": [140, 1066, 756, 1130], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[140.0, 1066.0], [756.0, 1066.0], [756.0, 1130.0], [140.0, 1130.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、2015年，一员工刚买的新房没多久，物业还不是特别完善，家中被盗，丢失5000元左右。", "block_bbox": [142, 1172, 763, 1236], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 1172.0], [763.0, 1172.0], [763.0, 1236.0], [142.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [796, 850, 1042, 1045], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[796.0, 850.0], [1042.0, 850.0], [1042.0, 1045.0], [796.0, 1045.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [802, 1062, 1040, 1242], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[802.0, 1062.0], [1040.0, 1062.0], [1040.0, 1242.0], [802.0, 1242.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1270, 1123, 1315], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1270.0], [1123.0, 1270.0], [1123.0, 1315.0], [939.0, 1315.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.4905499517917633, "coordinate": [122, 92, 192, 128], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[122.0, 92.0], [192.0, 92.0], [192.0, 128.0], [122.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8033803701400757, "coordinate": [125, 160, 414, 190], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[125.0, 160.0], [414.0, 160.0], [414.0, 190.0], [125.0, 190.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8345373868942261, "coordinate": [125, 218, 455, 244], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[125.0, 218.0], [455.0, 218.0], [455.0, 244.0], [125.0, 244.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9357079863548279, "coordinate": [125, 251, 767, 344], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[125.0, 251.0], [767.0, 251.0], [767.0, 344.0], [125.0, 344.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9362601041793823, "coordinate": [125, 351, 753, 444], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[125.0, 351.0], [753.0, 351.0], [753.0, 444.0], [125.0, 444.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9150576591491699, "coordinate": [125, 450, 750, 510], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[125.0, 450.0], [750.0, 450.0], [750.0, 510.0], [125.0, 510.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9307454824447632, "coordinate": [124, 517, 749, 610], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[124.0, 517.0], [749.0, 517.0], [749.0, 610.0], [124.0, 610.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9033070802688599, "coordinate": [839, 258, 1075, 464], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 258.0], [1075.0, 258.0], [1075.0, 464.0], [839.0, 464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8709672689437866, "coordinate": [93, 678, 309, 712], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[93.0, 678.0], [309.0, 678.0], [309.0, 712.0], [93.0, 712.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.3948587477207184, "coordinate": [123, 763, 191, 802], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[123.0, 763.0], [191.0, 763.0], [191.0, 802.0], [123.0, 802.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8285802602767944, "coordinate": [143, 832, 298, 864], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[143.0, 832.0], [298.0, 832.0], [298.0, 864.0], [143.0, 864.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.592598021030426, "coordinate": [143, 888, 210, 916], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[143.0, 888.0], [209.0, 888.0], [209.0, 915.0], [143.0, 915.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8969111442565918, "coordinate": [141, 959, 762, 1023], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[141.0, 959.0], [762.0, 959.0], [762.0, 1023.0], [141.0, 1023.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9001548886299133, "coordinate": [140, 1066, 756, 1130], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[140.0, 1066.0], [756.0, 1066.0], [756.0, 1130.0], [140.0, 1130.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9061863422393799, "coordinate": [142, 1172, 763, 1236], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[142.0, 1172.0], [763.0, 1172.0], [763.0, 1236.0], [142.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9446606040000916, "coordinate": [796, 850, 1042, 1045], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[796.0, 850.0], [1042.0, 850.0], [1042.0, 1045.0], [796.0, 1045.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9242526888847351, "coordinate": [802, 1062, 1040, 1242], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[802.0, 1062.0], [1040.0, 1062.0], [1040.0, 1242.0], [802.0, 1242.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.5809727311134338, "coordinate": [939, 1270, 1123, 1315], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 1270.0], [1123.0, 1270.0], [1123.0, 1315.0], [939.0, 1315.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## DL\n\n抢劫事件的预防及处理方法：\n\n8、穿戴适宜，尽量使自己活动方便；\n\n9、发现有人尾随或窥视，不要紧张露出胆怯神态，可回头多盯对方几眼，或哼首歌曲，并改变原走路线，朝有人、有灯的地方走；或打手机通知人接护。\n\n10、如果歹徒向你要皮夹或钱包，不要递给他，而是往远处丢去。歹徒很可能对财物比对你有兴趣，他会去拿皮夹或钱包，这是你逃跑的机会。往反方向拼命跑，待安全后，及时报警。\n\n11、永远搭电梯，不要走楼梯。（楼梯间是一个可怕的地方，容易让人形单影支，变成最好的犯罪场所。）\n\n12、假如歹徒有凶器而你并没有受到他的控制，一定要跑，一百次中，只有四次歹徒会袭击逃跑的目标；即使他攻击你，大多不会是致命的部位，所以要跑。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_839_258_1075_464.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"19%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 生活篇--盗窃事件\n\n## DÍ\n\n## 二、 盗窃事件：\n\n## 案例：\n\n1、2011年，一员工在冯庄租的民房，因夏季天气炎热晚上没关窗户，刚发的工资还没来得及存银行被盗；\n\n2、2012年，一员工在罗庄租的民房，下班后回到住处发现门锁被撬，房间里被洗劫一空；\n\n3、2015年，一员工刚买的新房没多久，物业还不是特别完善，家中被盗，丢失5000元左右。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_796_850_1042_1045.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"20%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_802_1062_1040_1242.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"20%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_839_258_1075_464.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//b51e4330-fa69-4676-8052-a9e153fbed22/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_839_258_1075_464.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqr